      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>These are great. I really want to drive home the point that these aren't just \"opinions\" but actual psychological realities. For the video, can you expand on point #3? Like, give me a more detailed paragraph that explains exactly how this lack of respect for authority plays out in a classroom setting compared to more traditional discipline methods.",
